/E (Problem worth solving. 8% of orders are late and those orders account for most of the poor reviews. Late rates spike in specific months and regions, which suggests the delivery promise is not calibrated to actual conditions.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (What HVIA would build. A model that predicts, at checkout or at dispatch, the probability that an order will miss its promised date, using seller, product weight and size, origin-destination route and season. It feeds \(1\) more accurate delivery promises shown to the buyer, \(2\) early alerts for at-risk orders so support can intervene, and \(3\) a seller and carrier scorecard.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
